{
  "info": {
    "name": "H2H Bank Jateng - Retribusi Puskesmas",
    "description": "Koleksi API untuk integrasi Host-to-Host (H2H) antara aplikasi Retribusi Puskesmas dengan Bank Jateng.\n\nEndpoint tersedia di:\n- Production: https://retribusi-puskesmas.aplikasi-anda.go.id\n- Development: http://localhost:8080\n\nDokumentasi lengkap: docs/PROSES_BISNIS_TAGIHAN_PEMBAYARAN.md",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "18026072"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth (GET /h2h/auth)",
      "description": "Endpoint autentikasi untuk mendapatkan x-api-key (token).\n\nAlur:\n1. Kirim Authorization: Basic base64(kredensial)\n2. Server akan generate dan mengembalikan x-api-key\n3. Token berlaku 1 jam, digunakan pada header x-api-key untuk Inquiry & Payment",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Basic {{base64}}",
            "type": "text",
            "description": "Basic Auth: username:password → encode base64"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/h2h/auth",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["h2h", "auth"]
        }
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "code": 200,
          "body": {
            "x-api-key": "{{x-api-key}}",
            "resp_code": "00",
            "resp_desc": "Success"
          }
        }
      ],
      "auth": {
        "type": "basic",
        "basic": [
          { "key": "username", "value": "bankjateng" },
          { "key": "password", "value": "puskesmas123" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Inquiry (POST /h2h/inquiry)",
      "description": "Endpoint untuk mengecek tagihan pasien berdasarkan No. RM.\n\nAlur:\n1. Gunakan x-api-key dari response Auth (di header)\n2. Kirim No. RM pasien\n3. Server mengembalikan data pasien & rincian tagihan (max 7 item)\n\nData yang dikembalikan:\n- nama_pasien\n- alamat_pasien\n- jenis_kelamin\n- tgl_lahir\n- usia\n- total_tagihan\n- tagihan[] (masing-masing item dengan no_kwitansi & nominal_tagihan)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{x-api-key}}",
            "type": "text",
            "description": "Token dari response Auth"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"no_rm\": \"2304002648\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/h2h/inquiry",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["h2h", "inquiry"]
        }
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "code": 200,
          "body": {
            "resp_code": "00",
            "resp_desc": "data ditemukan",
            "no_rm": "2304002648",
            "kode_puskesmas": "330600101Z",
            "nama_pasien": "MUHAMMAD ARIF WICAKSONO",
            "alamat_pasien": "Jl. Pahlawan No. 123, Purworejo",
            "jenis_kelamin": "LAKI-LAKI",
            "usia": "32",
            "tgl_lahir": "1994-10-10",
            "total_tagihan": "270000",
            "tagihan": [
              {
                "no_kwitansi": "S000000001",
                "nominal_tagihan": "150000",
                "Keterangan": "Pemeriksaan Umum (RET-3306001-260814-99887)"
              },
              {
                "no_kwitansi": "S000000002",
                "nominal_tagihan": "120000",
                "Keterangan": "Pemeriksaan Gigi (RET-3306001-260814-99887)"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Payment (POST /h2h/payment)",
      "description": "Endpoint pelunasan / posting transaksi.\n\nAlur:\n1. Kirim x-api-key (header)\n2. Kirim no_rm, total_tagihan, & noreff (nomor referensi Bank)\n3. Validasi idempotency (jika noreff sudah diproses, tidak duplikat)\n4. Status → PAID, timestamp updated_at, noreff_bank\n5. Kembalikan no_reff (RV-{id})",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "x-api-key",
            "value": "{{x-api-key}}",
            "type": "text"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"no_rm\": \"2304002648\",\n  \"total_tagihan\": \"270000\",\n  \"noreff\": \"BANKJATENG-20260814-001\",\n  \"channel\": \"mobile_banking\",\n  \"device\": \"ANDROID\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/h2h/payment",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["h2h", "payment"]
        }
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "code": 200,
          "body": {
            "resp_code": "00",
            "resp_desc": "Success",
            "no_reff": "RV-2"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Simulator H2H (GET /eretribusi/h2h-test)",
      "description": "Halaman simulasi / test internal untuk memverifikasi seluruh alur H2H sebelum produksi.\n\nDigunakan oleh:\n- Admin Kabupaten / Developer\n- Untuk tes end-to-end tanpa melibatkan Bank Jateng\n- Data dummy sudah disediakan via seeder",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Authorization",
            "value": "Basic {{base64}}",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/eretribusi/h2h-test",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["eretribusi", "h2h-test"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Auto-fill Pasien (GET /eretribusi/pasien/cari/{no_rm})",
      "description": "API internal untuk auto-fill data pasien saat kasir mengetik No. RM.\n\nDigunakan di:\n- Form /eretribusi/transaksi/new\n- Ketika No. RM di-blur, otomatis mengisi nama, alamat, jenis_kelamin, tgl_lahir",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/eretribusi/pasien/cari/2304002648",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["eretribusi", "pasien", "cari", "2304002648"]
        }
      },
      "response": [
        {
          "code": 200,
          "body": {
            "status": "success",
            "nama_pasien": "MUHAMMAD ARIF WICAKSONO",
            "alamat_pasien": "Jl. Pahlawan No. 123, Purworejo",
            "jenis_kelamin": "LAKI-LAKI",
            "tgl_lahir": "1994-10-10"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "base64",
      "value": "YmFua2phdGVuZzpwdXNrZXNtYXMxMjM=",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base64 dari 'bankjateng:puskesmas123'"
    },
    {
      "key": "x-api-key",
      "value": "{{x-api-key}}",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Token dari response Auth, perlu diset secara manual via test script atau ambil dari response"
    }
  ]
}